timestamp=2026-11-04T12:39:46.738Z level=INFO run=56dc2648 message=evaluated permission=bash pattern="python3 << 'PY'\n# The violations are clustered around 2023-07-18 early morning. Only one batch (03:17:00) was dispatched during this critical window.\n# After that, no more violations. Before that, no violations. That 03:17:00 batch is the unmistakable disposal event.\n# The other dispatches on 2023-07-18 after temps recovered (09:44:49, 16:17:10 meat dispatches) happened when meat was back at ~1-2°C - safe. So they should be counted as sales.\n# That seems to be the only spoilage event.\n\n# Let us also look at everything else. For example, are there any dispatches of frozen goods at very high ambient temps? No obvious other violations.\n# Also check for any other batches that might have been affected? Maybe multiple small dispatches during unsafe window? No - only the 03:17 batch.\n\n# So total expected revenue = sum of all dispatches except the ones from the 03:17:00 batch on 2023-07-18 (all 8 line items).\nPY" action.permission=* action.action=allow action.pattern=*
